window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When there is forbidden temptation, there is only one outcome....</p> <p><b>Rue</b></p> <p>Climbing the ladder of the secret society is everything I wanted, but when Isaac is assigned as my guard, a flame enkindles my royal blood. Fifteen years older than me, his imposing presence tempts me, and I can’t deny his forbidden allure. The fire that burns in him ignites a passion far more dangerous than anything I was prepared for. Now I have an impossible choice: risk it all or lose him forever.</p> <p><b>Isaac</b></p> <p>I'm a cold and deadly enforcer of a secret society, an emotionless duty until I meet the princess. She is captivating, drawing me in like a moth to an alluring flame. An unstoppable force that consumes my every thought. But to her royal family, I'm just a pawn, a guard whose sole purpose is to keep her safe. My assignment becomes both a blessing and a curse as being near her only heightens my longing for her, but she is untouchable. Until she makes a sacrifice that will cost her everything.</p> <p><i>Tempt Me</i> is a forbidden age-gap romance with praise. This is a duet that ends in an HEA. Contains triggers and content warnings (see preface). Takes place in the fictional city of Coe Bay.</p>"; 
